<section style="background: #FFFFFF">
<div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 56px); line-height: 1; color: #141414">Privacy Policy</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #141414">Last updated: November 12, 2026</p>
<p style="margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere">Scooter Bennett Septic is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy governs our data collection, processing, and usage practices. By using our website or opting into our services, including SMS communications, you consent to the data practices described in this statement.</p>
<h2 style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.1; color: #141414">Tracking Information</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere">Information about your computer hardware and software may be automatically collected by Scooter Bennett Septic. This information can include your IP address, browser type, device type, domain names, access times, and referring website addresses. This information is used for the operation of the service, to maintain the quality of the service, for security monitoring, analytics purposes, and to provide general statistics regarding use of our website.</p>
<h2 style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.1; color: #141414">Cookies</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere">A &ldquo;cookie&rdquo; is a text file that is placed on your device by a web server. Cookies are not used to run programs or deliver viruses to your computer. Cookies are uniquely assigned to you and can only be read by a web server in the domain that issued the cookie. Our website may use cookies to help personalize your online experience, improve website functionality, analyze traffic, and support marketing and advertising efforts. You may delete or block cookies from this site through your browser settings; however, some elements of the website may not function correctly.</p>
<h2 style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.1; color: #141414">Website Data Collection and Use Practices</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere">Scooter Bennett Septic may collect personally identifiable information such as your name, email address, company name, mailing address, telephone number, and mobile phone number when voluntarily submitted by you. We collect and use personal data that is adequate, relevant, and limited to what is necessary for the intended purpose of delivering the services you request. We may use your information to operate our website, provide requested services, respond to inquiries, deliver customer support, improve our services, and send communications related to our services.</p>
<h2 style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.1; color: #141414">SMS Communications</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere">If you provide your mobile phone number and give explicit consent by submitting a form on our website, you agree to receive SMS messages from Scooter Bennett Septic. Consent is collected through an unchecked checkbox on the form prior to submission.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere">Messages may include appointment confirmations, service updates, customer support responses, and promotional or follow-up messages related to your inquiry. Message frequency may vary. Message and data rates may apply.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere">You may opt out of receiving SMS messages at any time by replying STOP to any message you receive. For assistance, reply HELP or contact us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> or <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere">Consent to receive SMS messages is not a condition of purchase. Scooter Bennett Septic maintains records of SMS opt-in consent in accordance with applicable laws and industry standards.</p>
<h2 style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.1; color: #141414">Disclosure of Information to Outside Parties</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere">Scooter Bennett Septic does not sell, rent, or trade your personally identifiable information to outside parties. This does not include trusted vendors or service providers who assist in operating our business.</p>
<h2 style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.1; color: #141414">Mobile Information Policy</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere">No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent information will not be shared with any third parties outside of Scooter Bennett Septic, except with trusted service providers who assist in delivering SMS communications.</p>
<h2 style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.1; color: #141414">Data Security and Handling</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere">Scooter Bennett Septic implements reasonable safeguards to protect personal data from unauthorized access or disclosure.</p>
<h2 style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.1; color: #141414">Data Retention</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere">Scooter Bennett Septic retains personal information only as long as necessary for business or legal purposes.</p>
<h2 style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.1; color: #141414">User Rights</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere">Users may request access, correction, or deletion of their data by contacting <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
